; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR SORT  -  watch $FC PULSESORTXY sort twenty numbers   (VM1 @ $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Press any key to start. Twenty random numbers (1-60) appear as bars; each
; pass is ONE $FC PULSESORTXY opcode - a bubble-sort pass - and only the bars
; that moved are redrawn. When a pass finds nothing to swap it stops and shows
; how many passes it took. Then:  A sort up   D sort down   N new numbers   Q quit
;
; $FC PULSESORTXY ZD XY: one bubble pass over RX..RY (RY = the LAST element),
; Z = 0 up / 1 down, D = cell size in bytes. ExitCode $01 = something swapped,
; $00 = already in order, so a full sort is "pass, TESTEXIT 00, repeat".
; Measured on V0061.33: 160 random arrays (1- and 2-byte cells, both directions)
; identical to a Python bubble pass; full sorts take bubble sort's pass count.
; The first app to use $FC.
;
; VT100 only (reverse video, cursor addressing, erase-to-end-of-line). RAND is
; spun while it waits for the first key, so each run sorts different numbers.
; The pause between passes is the DLYI operand at $408E (now $06).
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/sortvis_verify.py, V0061.33 image): the output is
; replayed into a VT100 screen and, after EVERY pass, the twenty bars must show
; exactly a Python bubble sort's state after that pass - up, down (D) and new numbers (N) sorts all match, pass for pass.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 199 STELLAR commands, $4000-$4200 (513 bytes).  Arrays at $4900/$4940, the bar's
; run of spaces at $4A00, strings at $4B00.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START                              Start of program, and run the label pre-pass
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A                    Ten, for printing numbers
; D 4005 11 02 00 14    LOADXI R2 0014                     How many numbers
; D 4009 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, clear the screen, hide the cursor
; D 400B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 400D CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 400F CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 4011 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4013 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4015 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4017 CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 4019 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 401B CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 401D CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 401F CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4021 CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4023 CA 6C          SEROUTI 6C 'l'
; D 4025 11 0D 00 01    LOADXI R13 0001
; D 4029 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 402D BD 01 DF       CALL POSXY
; D 4030 11 0E 0B 00    LOADXI R14 0B00
; D 4034 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The title on line 1
; D 4036 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 403A 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 403E BD 01 DF       CALL POSXY
; D 4041 11 0E 0B 41    LOADXI R14 0B41
; D 4045 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 4047 C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes - every run differs
; D 4048 CC             SERST
; D 4049 A1 00 47       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 404C CB             SERIN                              and throw the key away
; NEW:
; D 404D 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; D 4051 11 07 00 3C    LOADXI R7 003C
; FILL:
; D 4055 C3             RAND
; D 4056 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 4058 4D 67          DIVXY R6 / R7                      RAND mod 60
; D 405A 27             COPYREMA
; D 405B 4E 00 01       ADDAI 0001                         + 1
; D 405E 2F 03 09 00    WRITEIDX R3 0900
; D 4062 42 03          INCX R3
; D 4064 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 4066 A1 00 55       IFFALSEI FILL
; D 4069 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000                     Ascending
; SORT:
; D 406D 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000                     No passes yet
; D 4071 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000
; ALL:
; D 4075 BD 01 69       CALL DRAWROW
; D 4078 42 03          INCX R3
; D 407A 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 407C A1 00 75       IFFALSEI ALL
; D 407F BD 01 B7       CALL STATUS
; PASS:
; D 4082 11 0D 09 00    LOADXI R13 0900
; D 4086 11 0E 09 40    LOADXI R14 0940
; D 408A 3B DE 14       COPYMXMY R13 R14 14                Keep the numbers as they were
; D 408D C0 06          DLYI 06                            The watching speed
; D 408F 11 06 09 00    LOADXI R6 0900
; D 4093 11 07 09 13    LOADXI R7 0913                     RX = first, RY = LAST element
; D 4097 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4099 A1 00 A2       IFFALSEI DOWN
; D 409C FC 01 67       PULSESORTXY up, bytes, R6..R7      ONE bubble pass, ascending
; D 409F B0 00 A5       GAL PASSED
; DOWN:
; D 40A2 FC 11 67       PULSESORTXY down, bytes, R6..R7    ONE bubble pass, descending
; PASSED:
; D 40A5 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 40A9 96 00          TESTEXIT 00                        ExitCode $00: nothing was swapped
; D 40AB A1 00 B2       IFFALSEI SWAPPED
; D 40AE 11 08 00 01    LOADXI R8 0001                     Remember it - drawing must not be what decides
; SWAPPED:
; D 40B2 42 01          INCX R1
; D 40B4 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000                     Redraw only the lines that changed
; CHG:
; D 40B8 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 40BC 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 40BE 2E 03 09 40    READIDX R3 0940
; D 40C2 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 40C4 87 67          TESTXY R6 = R7
; D 40C6 A0 00 CC       IFTRUEI SAME
; D 40C9 BD 01 69       CALL DRAWROW
; SAME:
; D 40CC 42 03          INCX R3
; D 40CE 87 32          TESTXY R3 = R2
; D 40D0 A1 00 B8       IFFALSEI CHG
; D 40D3 BD 01 B7       CALL STATUS
; D 40D6 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 40D8 A0 00 82       IFTRUEI PASS                       Something moved: another pass
; DONE:
; D 40DB 11 0E 0B 94    LOADXI R14 0B94
; D 40DF C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Sorted
; D 40E1 11 0D 00 18    LOADXI R13 0018
; D 40E5 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 40E9 BD 01 DF       CALL POSXY
; D 40EC CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Clear the old prompt
; D 40EE CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 40F0 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 40F2 11 0E 0B 59    LOADXI R14 0B59
; D 40F6 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; KEY:
; D 40F8 CB             SERIN                              Wait for a key (other VMs keep running)
; D 40F9 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6
; D 40FB 86 06 00 71    TESTXI R6 0071
; D 40FF A0 01 44       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 4102 86 06 00 51    TESTXI R6 0051
; D 4106 A0 01 44       IFTRUEI QUIT
; D 4109 86 06 00 61    TESTXI R6 0061
; D 410D A0 01 36       IFTRUEI UP
; D 4110 86 06 00 41    TESTXI R6 0041
; D 4114 A0 01 36       IFTRUEI UP
; D 4117 86 06 00 64    TESTXI R6 0064
; D 411B A0 01 3D       IFTRUEI DN
; D 411E 86 06 00 44    TESTXI R6 0044
; D 4122 A0 01 3D       IFTRUEI DN
; D 4125 86 06 00 6E    TESTXI R6 006E
; D 4129 A0 00 4D       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 412C 86 06 00 4E    TESTXI R6 004E
; D 4130 A0 00 4D       IFTRUEI NEW
; D 4133 B0 00 F8       GAL KEY
; UP:
; D 4136 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000
; D 413A B0 00 6D       GAL SORT
; DN:
; D 413D 11 05 00 01    LOADXI R5 0001
; D 4141 B0 00 6D       GAL SORT
; QUIT:
; D 4144 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video, cursor back, clear, home
; D 4146 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4148 CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 414A CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 414C CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 414E CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4150 CA 3F          SEROUTI 3F '?'
; D 4152 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 4154 CA 35          SEROUTI 35 '5'
; D 4156 CA 68          SEROUTI 68 'h'
; D 4158 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 415A CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 415C CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'
; D 415E CA 4A          SEROUTI 4A 'J'
; D 4160 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 4162 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 4164 CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 4166 F0 00 00       BREAK                              End of program
; DRAWROW:
; D 4169 23 00 3D       COPYXY R3 -> R13
; D 416C 52 0D 00 03    ADDXI R13 0003                     screen line
; D 4170 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 4174 BD 01 DF       CALL POSXY
; D 4177 2E 03 09 00    READIDX R3 0900
; D 417B 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4                   R4 = the value
; D 417D 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 417F 25             COPYMAA
; D 4180 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4183 C9             SEROUT                             tens
; D 4184 27             COPYREMA
; D 4185 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4188 C9             SEROUT                             units
; D 4189 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 418B CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Reverse video: a space is a block
; D 418D CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 418F CA 37          SEROUTI 37 '7'
; D 4191 CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 4193 10 00 00       LOADAI 0000
; D 4196 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   Cut the run of spaces to the value
; D 419A 11 0E 0A 00    LOADXI R14 0A00
; D 419E C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       the bar
; D 41A0 10 00 20       LOADAI 0020
; D 41A3 2F 04 0A 00    WRITEIDX R4 0A00                   and mend it
; D 41A7 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B                         Normal video; erase what the old bar left
; D 41A9 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41AB CA 30          SEROUTI 30 '0'
; D 41AD CA 6D          SEROUTI 6D 'm'
; D 41AF CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41B1 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41B3 CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 41B5 BE 00          RETURN
; STATUS:
; D 41B7 11 0D 00 17    LOADXI R13 0017
; D 41BB 11 0E 00 01    LOADXI R14 0001
; D 41BF BD 01 DF       CALL POSXY
; D 41C2 11 0E 0B 8E    LOADXI R14 0B8E
; D 41C6 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41C8 23 00 14       COPYXY R1 -> R4
; D 41CB 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 41CD 25             COPYMAA
; D 41CE 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41D1 C9             SEROUT
; D 41D2 27             COPYREMA
; D 41D3 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41D6 C9             SEROUT
; D 41D7 CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41D9 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41DB CA 4B          SEROUTI 4B 'K'
; D 41DD BE 00          RETURN
; POSXY:
; D 41DF CA 1B          SEROUTI 1B
; D 41E1 CA 5B          SEROUTI 5B '['
; D 41E3 4D DF          DIVXY R13 / R15
; D 41E5 25             COPYMAA
; D 41E6 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41E9 C9             SEROUT
; D 41EA 27             COPYREMA
; D 41EB 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41EE C9             SEROUT
; D 41EF CA 3B          SEROUTI 3B ';'
; D 41F1 4D EF          DIVXY R14 / R15
; D 41F3 25             COPYMAA
; D 41F4 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41F7 C9             SEROUT
; D 41F8 27             COPYREMA
; D 41F9 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41FC C9             SEROUT
; D 41FD CA 48          SEROUTI 48 'H'
; D 41FF BE 00          RETURN

